Hello Yann,


On 03/19/18 22:32, Yann E. MORIN wrote:
> Could you please attach this packages-file-list.txt please?

Here you go.

I think it is related to output from ca-certificates. This package installs some files with non 
ascii chars in the certificate filenames. The strange part is that I have done this for a long time 
and do not really understand why it is failing now.

And shouldn't this script use host-python instead of the python which is present on the host? Could 
be a PATH related issue in the execution environment for this script?


regards,


Jaap
